              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پرستار نبض بیمار را گرفت. parastâr nabz-e bimâr râ gereft. The nurse took the patient's pulse."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "nabz gereftan — to take a pulse."
            }
