          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "nabz was borrowed from Arabic nabḍ, 'pulse' (EtymDB). EtymDB takes Urdu and Hindi nabz from the same Arabic word (EtymDB)."
