              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "درمان کردن (darmân kardan) — \"to treat (an illness)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "این دکتر بیماری پوست را درمان میکند. in doktor bimâri-ye pust râ darmân mikonad. This doctor treats skin disease."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "darmân 'cure, treatment' + kardan. darmângâh 'clinic' is built on the same noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "darmân is inherited: EtymDB traces it to Middle Persian, where it meant 'remedy, medicine' (EtymDB). kardan, 'to do', is inherited too."
            }
          ]
        },
