              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بچه ها در مدرسه واکسن زدند. bachchehâ dar madrese vâksan zadand. The children had their jabs at school."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "vâksan 'vaccine' + zadan 'to strike'. It covers both giving and getting a jab."
            }
